  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a vintage black-and-white photograph of a man and a woman dressed in formal historical attire, likely from the late 19th or early 20th century. The text overlay reads: 'i bet they make squeaky toy sounds when they fuck.' This juxtaposition of a formal, historical portrait with vulgar, sexually explicit and infantilizing text creates a deliberately offensive and degrading message. The intent is to mock and demean the subjects by reducing them to the level of toys, which is a form of objectification and infantilization. This is harmful as it uses visual material (a dignified historical portrait) to deliver a crude, degrading message that targets the subjects' dignity and humanity. The meme is designed to shock and provoke, using the contrast between the formal image and the vulgar text to generate a crude, offensive humor that is inherently demeaning and potentially harmful to the subjects or to viewers who may find the content offensive or triggering. The overall intent is to elicit a reaction through shock value and degradation, which is harmful due to its demeaning and objectifying nature.",
